OL,3,ATrial date of alleged Charlie Kirk
OL,4,Akiller set for June 2028
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trial of Tyler Robinson, the man
OL,7,Faccused of killing conservative
OL,8,Factivist Charlie Kirk, will start in
OL,9,FJune 2028, a judge has ordered.
OL,11,FRobinson, 23, has pleaded not guilty to
OL,12,Faggravated murder and six other charges
OL,13,Fin connection with the September 2025
OL,14,Fkilling of Kirk, 31, who was shot while
OL,15,Fhe spoke at a Utah college campus.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
