OL,3,ATrial date of alleged Charlie Kirk
OL,4,Akiller set for June 2028
OL,5,
OL,6,FUtah County judge Tony Graf Jr on
OL,7,FMonday told the court that jury
OL,8,Fselection would begin on 21 June, 2028.
OL,9,FThe prosecution has estimated the trial
OL,10,Fcould last 17 weeks, while defence
OL,11,Flawyers have said it could take seven
OL,12,Fmonths.
OL,14,FRobinson could face the death penalty
OL,15,Fif found guilty of aggravated murder,
OL,16,Fsomething his defence team has sought
OL,17,Fto prevent.
